      </div>
      <figure class="bb-box-photo">
        <img src={img('boxoff')} alt="The finished box on a desk: a ply band bent round the corners, a white top, and the dial on its side" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption><b>The finished box.</b> The band bent round the faces, the white top on, the dial through the side.</figcaption>
