        <h4 class="bb-h">Version two, printed.</h4>
        <p class="bb-body">
          Two months on, I redrew the casing in Fusion 360 for 3D printing: a 64 mm shell and lid, with docks inside for the Nano, the matrix,
          the touch pad and the motor. It is printed; this is the model. Turn on Opacity to see inside.
        </p>
      </div>
